    "title": "Texas Tech Lady Raiders, featuring Brianna Hinson, secure 2-0 NCAA Tournament victory",
    "text": "Former Upland High School softball standout Brianna Hinson helped her college team, the Texas Tech Lady Raiders, claim a 2-0 win over the Alabama Crimson Tide in the NCAA Tournament on Monday, June 1.\nThe contest was held at Devon Park starting at 9 p.m.\nThe Lady Raiders are scheduled to play at Devon Park again on Wednesday, June 3, at 7 p.m.\nBrianna Hinson — Infielder — Freshman — 5′5″ — Hometown: Upland",
